Embedded fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
------------------------------------------
Every SVG ephemvis renders embeds a small set of astrology glyphs so charts
render identically on any device. Those glyphs are a curated subset of the
Google **Noto** fonts, re-packaged by the `astroglyphs_2K` toolkit and vendored
into `src/ephemvis/_fontdata.py` at build time. They are NOT MIT-licensed — they
are distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see LICENSES/OFL.txt).

The subsets are renamed per the OFL Reserved Font Name clause (AstroSym,
AstroSym2, AstroMath, AstroText) and derive from:

    Noto Sans Symbols    (Version 2.003)   -> AstroSym
    Noto Sans Symbols 2  (Version 2.008)   -> AstroSym2
    Noto Sans Math       (Version 3.000)   -> AstroMath
    Noto Sans            (Version 2.015)   -> AstroText

